          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Effects" typeId="fe13-6bab-c5cb-4f1d">When using the special order &apos;All Ahead Full&apos; or &apos;Burn Retros&apos; the ship may not use any of its lance batteries. This is because the ship needs to re&apos;channel the energy used to power these weapons back to the engines and thrusters.</characteristic>
